{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6a06337a-8f7b-88fb-9e01-dd60d2f2db72",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T13:12:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paula Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:10:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name is Paula Cabral. I am calling about the water and sewer bill for 151 Gidley Street. It is my neighbor's bill, she is an older lady, and I am helping her. I am on speakerphone, sorry, my hands are full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:11:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. What's going on with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sewer part is bigger than the water part. I do not understand this. Sewer should follow water, no? Also I hung a new curtain rod this morning, so I am a little dusty, but I have the bill here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:11:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sewer is usually calculated from the water used, so it normally tracks with it. Do you have the usage figure in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:11:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, um, it says usage, then a number, then a different number for charge. [pause] Which one is the, the consumption?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:11:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The usage number is the consumption. The charge is what you're billed for it. The two charges are listed separately."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:11:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So she asks me to ask, is there any discount for low-income or elderly households? She is on a fixed income."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:11:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There may be a program. I'll send you the information, but I can't confirm eligibility from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:11:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And I want to be authorized on the account. I am not family, I am next door. Her daughter also helps, in Providence. She wants to be authorized too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The account holder would need to sign an authorization form. Each helper would be listed on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:12:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And if we dispute the charge, formally, how do we do that? In writing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:12:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a written request to the billing office, with the account number and the reason. I'll mail the form too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T13:12:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think I understand. Maybe. Thank you."
    }
  ],
